cabal-version: 3.0
name:          hanalyze-demos
version:       0.2.0.1
synopsis:      Demo and benchmark executables for the hanalyze toolkit
description:
    The 151 demo and benchmark executables of the hanalyze toolkit.
    They cover Haskell-side benchmarks that feed the Python aggregator,
    HBM / MCMC / variational-inference demos, the cross-implementation
    posteriordb benchmark suite (one executable per model), design of
    experiments and optimisation, regression and Gaussian processes, CSV
    loading and cleaning, and both Vega-Lite and static hgg output.
    This package has no library.
    .
    It started as the Phase 106.4 isolation of plot-dependent executables
    (which cannot live inside the umbrella package without a package cycle);
    Phase 109.2 (2026-07-24) moved the remaining demo/bench executables out
    of the umbrella as well. It is opt-in and never a default target, so
    build it via the dedicated project file:
      cabal build --project-file=cabal.project.demos hanalyze-demos
    See README.md for the per-directory breakdown.
license:       BSD-3-Clause
author:        Toshiaki Honda
maintainer:    frenzieddoll@gmail.com
copyright:     2026 Aelysce Project (Toshiaki Honda)
category:      Math, Statistics, Numeric, Machine Learning
build-type:    Simple
tested-with:   GHC == 9.6.7
extra-source-files:
    README.md
    README.ja.md

common warnings
  ghc-options: -Wall -Wcompat -Widentities -Wredundant-constraints

-- Phase 109.2 (2026-07-24): demo/ demo-plot/ bench/haskell/ は本 package 配下へ
-- git mv 済 (106.4/106.8 妥協の解消)。 残る package 外参照は ../bench/posteriordb と
-- ../experiments のみ = Phase 89 branch (posteriordb 継続中) との rebase 衝突回避の
-- 暫定で、 89 合流後に本 package 配下へ git mv する (phase-109 md TODO)。

-- posteriordb 実行体 (Phase 89) の共通 deps。
common posteriordb-deps
  build-depends:
      base
    , aeson
    , text
    , vector
    , hanalyze
    , hanalyze-plot
    , hgg-core
    , hgg-frame
    , hgg-rasterific
    , time
    , deepseq

